<%# @user, @details, @reset_password_url are set by the mailer %>
Hi <%= @user.name %>,

Your Beach Volleyball Hub account was just accessed from a new sign-in. Here are the details:

Time:             <%= @details.login_at %>
Location:         <%= @details.location %>
IP address:       <%= @details.ip_address %>
Device:           <%= @details.device %>
Operating system: <%= @details.os %>
Browser:          <%= @details.browser_with_version %>
Sign-in method:   <%= @details.login_method %>

If this was you, you can safely ignore this email.

If you don't recognise this sign-in, someone may have accessed your account.
Please secure it immediately by resetting your password:

<%= @reset_password_url %>

— Beach Volleyball Hub Security Team
